{
  "id": "memory_cube_guide",
  "title": "Memory Cube",
  "item": "omnira:memory_cube",
  "text": [
    "Each game day, extract one memory from a peaceful cube and one from a corrupted cube. Both cubes remain in place.",
    "Opening a memory consumes it and drops six materials. Costs scale with maximum mana or health. Corrupted Memory rounds its health cost up, so opening it at half health can kill you. The materials still drop."
